    "catalog:version": "1.0.0",
    "catalog:license": "CC-BY-4.0",
    "catalog:attribution": "Vishwajeet Mane",
    "catalog:category": "sanitary",
    "catalog:placement": "free",
    "catalog:lod": "300",
    "catalog:tags": "shower, shower enclosure, bathroom",
    "catalog:note": "Corner shower enclosure on a tray: rim 0.04. The back wall is on wallFace and the left side (-x) is a wall too; mirror the block for the other hand. Glass 0.010 on the tray rim, 0.03 in from its edge, 0.002 clear of the door frame: a fixed panel and a door at the front, a side panel at +x. The door frame is one sweep; the door swings out (swing). The gully sits flush in a hole through the tray floor. A riser stands on the valve on its axis and carries the head; it builds as a prism.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Drafting standard key dimensions (practice, verify; EN 14527 for the tray), not read, unverified; ports BS EN 12056-2 via the drafting standard, not read, unverified; height 2.00 practice size, unverified",
    "ifc:class": "IfcSanitaryTerminal",
    "ifc:predefinedType": "SHOWER",
    "ifcClass": "IfcSanitaryTerminal",
